  "description": "Read-only marksman log for League of Legends Heroes: for every marksman in a match it counts what the game's AI has them do while an enemy champion stands within their attack range and their attack is ready (attack the champion, attack something else, walk toward, walk away, cast, nothing), their attacks and casts, and writes it to league_ai_watch.log. Changes nothing in the game.",
